{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:576f377fce860e295ff106c07a591e78bdc6cc57daeb5d2a32911e7083453f30",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a001ce06a447efc4db64382d0fd0ef634040f5af3d1e47516ef11deb752ba5f2",
      "text": "感觉要是成了偶像，能被更多的女孩子们\n众星捧月般围着……吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8b0f6f0ae8d5bf234c2a0462a98640b8924ffc532a46aacdd651d89f6caedb9",
      "text": "哈……哈啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89b8c711c303be2c731c81a606711d8b4fb91e7bb03bbb09baee0cb24139be6a",
      "text": "哎呀，有那么值得惊讶吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6bf104223bfc66c208b050ea0cd2563b50bbb509db274d846e2185483978492",
      "text": "冬马不也多多少少\n希望能受女孩子欢迎吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8967866af7940bbb8158ec3b30d825942e330b092b2be389d6b4c06823283eb5",
      "text": "什……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8400967d18275beede1192114aa5643786bf8a608af9a32f0e7e5345aff1b2f6",
      "text": "脸居然红成那样。难不成，\n你对女孩子没什么免疫力……啊，抱歉来电话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ce488aef5aa005ddd697ddf02b71bfc605b09778cf9800152746646b046e715",
      "text": "喂？……呵呵，谢谢你的邀请。\n当然没问题哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87862d65fa0f6740d72dfdc4a77a87c18493de8f042f6a684a872761f8561452",
      "text": "我知道一家夜景很漂亮的餐厅。\n我马上就去预约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e2f7fb33c0e0d8f24e324cfc5876a1e965592776af2a3189895a77199ce99a1",
      "text": "相信你一定会喜欢的。\n不过……比起夜景，你更加美丽哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94189670b0a067fa2dcf7298b030a9caba0e0be335e08c544292294d1d644047",
      "text": "（搞什么啊，那种轻浮的台词……！\n能这么若无其事地说出口，简直无法理解！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_d:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3be25fa32f392649014701c162f3ff11dc0cb76f37a6f59ba9fb91ec052fe0aa",
      "text": "（翔太我行我素，北斗是个搭讪狂。\n跟这两个家伙组队，真的没问题吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
